        <mxCell id="n255" value="Storage&#10;Question: QuestionSet.questions[] and LiveQuestion.question.&#10;Answer: SetAttempt.answers[] and optional LiveQuestion.answer.&#10;OverallEvaluation: optional Session.overallEvaluation and LiveSession.overallEvaluation.&#10;&#10;These values use Object / [Object] properties; nested interface fields are not schema-validated.&#10;Question.id and Answer.id are application strings, not generated subdocument ObjectIds.&#10;&#10;Logical collection link: SessionEvaluation.attemptIds[] → string(SetAttempt._id).&#10;The schema stores String[] with no ref declaration; it cannot automatically populate this link." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1">
